{"id":"3e71f70cb66ea186","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-ultraproduct-notation.md","title":"Ultraproduct Notation","display":"df-ultraproduct-notation — Ultraproduct Notation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-ultraproduct-notation","aliases":["17-df-ultraproduct-notation"],"display":"df-ultraproduct-notation — Ultraproduct Notation","depends_on":["[[17-df-ultraproduct]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","source_verification":"statement-compared; notation variant","source_section":"4.1","source_result":"local notation for source ultraproduct","source_pages_print":[215,216],"source_pages_djvu":[231,232],"legacy_label":"17-df-4.2.2b"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-ultraproduct-notation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-ultraproduct-notation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ultraproduct-notation — Ultraproduct Notation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ed1712b26584150e\" href=\"?note=ed1712b26584150e\" title=\"17-df-ultraproduct\">17-df-ultraproduct</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; notation variant"},{"key":"source_section","html":"4.1"},{"key":"source_result","html":"local notation for source ultraproduct"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>215</span><span>216</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>231</span><span>232</span></div>"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-4.2.2b"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 是非空集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}\">\\((\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-结构族，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 上的超滤子。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ultraproduct}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{Ultraproduct}_L\\)</span> 及其元理论假设见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ed1712b26584150e\" href=\"?note=ed1712b26584150e\" title=\"17-df-ultraproduct\">17-df-ultraproduct</a>。以下为唯一满足该谓词的结构引入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathfrak A_i/U\">\\(\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathfrak A_i/U\\)</span> 记号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak B\">\\(\\mathfrak B\\)</span> 为候选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-结构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(\\mathfrak B=\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathfrak A_i/U\\right)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Ultraproduct}_L((\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I},U,\\mathfrak B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(\\mathfrak B=\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathfrak A_i/U\\right)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Ultraproduct}_L((\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I},U,\\mathfrak B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书印刷 pp.215–216（DjVu 231–232）使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prod_U\\mathfrak A_i\">\\(\\prod_U\\mathfrak A_i\\)</span>；这里是同一完整结构的本地带指标记法。归约积构造的非空性、代表元无关性与逐符号解释唯一性保证右侧有唯一结构输出，故此记号是良定义的结构项。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-ultraproduct","status":"resolved","id":"ed1712b26584150e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-ultraproduct]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ultraproduct","status":"resolved","id":"ed1712b26584150e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$I$ 是非空集合，$(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}$ 为 $L$-结构族，$U$ 为 $I$ 上的超滤子。$\\operatorname{Ultraproduct}_L$ 及其元理论假设见 [[17-df-ultraproduct]]。以下为唯一满足该谓词的结构引入 $\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathfrak A_i/U$ 记号；$\\mathfrak B$ 为候选 $L$-结构。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ultraproduct}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathfrak A_i/U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak B","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\left(\\mathfrak B=\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathfrak A_i/U\\right)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Ultraproduct}_L((\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I},U,\\mathfrak B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\prod_U\\mathfrak A_i","display":false}],"bytes":1357,"backlinks":[{"id":"99ff69edbf76f2a7","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"在 [[17-thm-los]] 所列 ZFC 元理论中，$I$ 非空，$(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}$ 为 $L$-结构族，$U$ 是 $I$ 上的超滤子。$P$ 及 $[f]_U$ 取其超积构造的乘积与商类；商结构记号见 [[17-df-ultraproduct-notation]]。$\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$ 与元组满足分别见 [[17-df-type]]、[[17-df-tuple-satisfaction]]。"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-149","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-compactness]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem]]\n[[17-df-aleph-one-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-aleph-zero-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-algebraic-closure]]\n[[17-df-assignment]]\n[[17-df-assignment-predicate]]\n[[17-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model-notation]]\n[[17-df-bool-comb]]\n[[17-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valued-expansion]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valued-relation]]\n[[17-df-bound-variable]]\n[[17-df-cardinal-arithm